block DRUM drum.likes.v1 floats=721
retired DRUM drum_velocity_zone 2026-11-17 the velocity mode, a coordinate that wrapped through Level, Tone and Tension, became a row of depths (drum_vel_level, drum_vel_tone, drum_vel_snap, drum_vel_tension, drum_velocity_noise); the old default is the new default
retired DRUM drum_wires 2026-11-17 the wires' mode, a coordinate that wrapped through four named mixes, became one amount each (drum_wire_contour, drum_wire_buzz, drum_wire_threshold, drum_wire_gate, drum_body_gate); the old default is the new default
retired DRUM drum_bells 2026-11-17 the bells' mode, a coordinate that wrapped through five named mixes, became one amount each (drum_bell1_level, drum_bell2_level, drum_bell_q, drum_bell_link); the old default is the new default
